  "title": "Cluster To Array preserves homogeneous I64",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Cluster To Array preserves homogeneous I64",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Homogeneous fields retain their exact integer carrier. An integer above 2^53 remains unchanged, and stable Cluster field order determines Array order.\n\nHomogeneous fields retain their exact integer carrier. An integer above 2^53 remains unchanged, and stable Cluster field order determines Array order.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.array.owned@1.\nExpected:\nresult (array<i64>) = [9007199254740993,-7]\n",
